            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Issis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and fast. Tips: use frozen fruit or freeze juice into cubes. This works great in the summer. Buy fruit in season and cube and freeze on sheet pan - single layer at a time.",
