              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Judy Neswald"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it just as suggested great.. then made it with no juice frozen banana frozen fresh pineapple almond milk and protein powder (non soy, non dairy) and scoop of almond ice cream and some almond yogurt.. A meal... now the ice cream was the treat for me.. but even without it filled me up. I leave out the ice cream and still wonderful \n5 stars cause really good as is...",
